window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"wukong","b":"locke","win":["Wukong","Wukong","Wukong","Wukong","Wukong","Wukong","Wukong"],"spikes":[{"when":"Lvl 1-3","text":"Crushing Blow's shred plus Q-reset autos win level 1 outright, and by 3 Warrior Trickster bait turns his whole E-W commit pattern into wasted cooldowns you punish for free."},{"when":"Lvl 6","text":"Level 6 is a grounding check - Purgatory (120s at rank 1) shuts off dashes, so commit before the artifact lands rather than after, and never linger at sliver HP inside its zone."},{"when":"1st item","text":"Item armor plus Stone Skin stacking blanks his W Soul Ignition burst; keep clone-baiting the combo and countering with the full E-Q-W rotation."},{"when":"Late","text":"Double-cast Cyclone re-engages after his escape and your passive sustain grinds him down - you enter every teamfight ahead."}],"wants":{"you":["Q-reset trades every time his nails whiff","Clone baits on his committed W windows","Cyclone committed before Purgatory grounds you"],"foe":["Layered Q Soul Nails marks before committing","Your real body found before he wastes W burst","R Purgatory dropped outside Cyclone range"]},"early":"Levels 1-3 you dictate everything: Crushing Blow shreds his armor while Q-reset autos win the exchange his Q Soul Nails starts, and once W Warrior Trickster is up you bait his E and his W onto the clone, then reappear and take the trade against empty cooldowns — his E is a flat 10s.","mid":"Levels 4-6 the gap widens - your E-Q clone all-in outdamages his grey-health steroid (W, 18s at rank 1), and at 6 you respect Purgatory instead of ignoring it: the zone grounds, so once it is down your dash out is gone. Commit before he throws it and finish above his execute floor.","late":"First item cements it - armor stacking blanks his one burst window while clone-baiting stays unsolvable for him - and late game Cyclone's second cast re-engages through his E reset escape while Stone Skin sustain keeps you healthy between fights. He never gets a stage of this game to himself.","whys":["Level-1 Crushing Blow shred and Q-reset autos out-trade his Soul Nails.","At 2 your armor-shred trades plus his W self-damage make every exchange yours.","Level 3 Warrior Trickster baits his E and W, then you reappear and punish.","Levels 4-5 your Q-reset all-in with clone outdamages his grey-health steroid.","Level 6 Cyclone still lands, but Purgatory grounds your dash out.","First-item armor and clone-baiting keep you winning the all-in.","Cyclone as a reset and your passive sustain keep you ahead into every teamfight."]});
