window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"wukong","b":"zaahen","win":["Skill","Wukong","Wukong","Skill","Skill","Wukong","Wukong"],"spikes":[{"when":"Lvl 2-3","text":"E Nimbus Strike into Q assembles a trade he cannot answer yet, and at 3 the full E-Q-W rotation shreds his armor while the clone dodges his counter-engage."},{"when":"Lvl 4-5","text":"His Q double-slash heal and his E dash burst come online - trade on cooldowns, not on principle, and keep the clone for his commit."},{"when":"Lvl 6","text":"Hold Cyclone discipline: if he banks his 110s R for your spin the all-in evens out - bait it with a clone engage first, then commit the real one."},{"when":"1st item","text":"Your shred plus item burst wins the straight duel again - force fights before he completes his second item."}],"wants":{"you":["E-Q trades on his early half-built kit","Clone baits eating his R and E cooldowns","First-item duels before his 2-item rotation"],"foe":["Q double-slash heal chip between engages","His 110s R held for your real Cyclone spin","Extended 4-5 trades on even cooldowns"]},"early":"Level 1 is mutual farming with no all-in threat, then you take the lane: at 2 E Nimbus Strike into Q Crushing Blow is a complete trade he has no answer for, and at 3 the full E-Q-W rotation shreds his armor while Warrior Trickster's clone eats the dash-and-slice he tries to respond with.","mid":"Levels 4-5 flatten out as he stabilises farm and both of you live on cooldown timings - his double-slash Q heals him every 10s at rank 1, so pick trades where your E starts and his 10s dash is down. Level 6 stays even: his R heals off the damage it deals, which is exactly why you bait it with the clone before spinning for real.","late":"First item hands the duel back to you - armor shred plus item burst beats his rotation in a straight fight - and two items in you stay ahead on the terms that matter: clone baits create picks he cannot scout, Cyclone breaks his all-in, and Grievous Wounds cuts the heal his Q and R both live on.","whys":["Level 1 is even - both of you just farm with no all-in threat.","You own level 2 as E-into-Q assembles a trade he cannot answer yet.","At 3 your full E-Q-W combo shreds his armor and the clone dodges his engage.","Levels 4-5 are even as he stabilises farm and you both trade on cooldowns.","Level 6 is even - his R Final Retribution answers your Cyclone if he holds it.","First item is yours: shred plus item burst wins the straight duel.","Two items in you stay ahead with clone pick pressure and Cyclone disengage."]});
