window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"wukong","b":"masteryi","win":["Wukong","Wukong","Wukong","Wukong","Master Yi","Skill","Master Yi"],"spikes":[{"when":"Lvl 1-3","text":"Crushing Blow's shred and superior base stats beat his Alpha Strike (20s at rank 1), and Nimbus Strike's attack speed wins every melee exchange - bully him off the wave."},{"when":"Lvl 4-5","text":"Keep pressing, and knock him up the second he starts Meditate (10s) - it is a channel, so the CC ends the heal outright and the trade is yours."},{"when":"Lvl 6","text":"Highlander (85s) makes him immune to slows and his kills refund cooldowns - shorten fights, land Cyclone early, and leave before his ramp catches up."},{"when":"Late","text":"Two items in his Double Strike and Wuju Style true damage outduel one rotation; switch to clone-and-Cyclone fights where your knockup beats the 1v1."}],"wants":{"you":["Early shred trades on his itemless levels","A lead banked before his Highlander era","Cyclone used to break his Meditate channel"],"foe":["Meditate healing him through your burst","Alpha Strike dodging your Cyclone spin","Extended late fights where resets take over"]},"early":"Levels 1-4 you are simply the bigger monkey: Crushing Blow shreds his armor and out-trades Alpha Strike (20s at rank 1, and his own autos shorten it), Nimbus Strike's bonus attack speed wins the melee slugfests, and his pre-item kit has no answer to your Q burst - take every trade and deny CS.","mid":"By 6 the current shifts: Highlander (85s) makes him slow-immune and refunds his cooldowns on a kill, so your fights must get shorter - open with the knockup, dump the rotation, exit on the clone. If he starts Meditate, knock him up: it is a channel and the heal dies with it. First item is a genuine skill window.","late":"Two items deep his Double Strike and Wuju Style true damage outduel your single burst rotation and the 1v1 stops being your business - become the teamfighter he cannot be: clone-scout the flank, Cyclone his whole team, and let your carries burn Highlander down while he is airborne.","whys":["Crushing Blow's armor shred and early stats beat his level-1 Alpha Strike.","At 2 Q plus Nimbus Strike attack speed out-trades his melee.","Level 3 gives you real kill pressure with Q shred while he still lacks resets.","Levels 4-5 you keep out-trading with Nimbus attack speed and Q burst.","By 6 Highlander (85s) makes him immune to slows and his resets tilt every extended trade.","First item is skill-dependent - your clone and Cyclone can still swing his DPS spike.","With two items his Double Strike DPS and Wuju true damage outduel one rotation."]});
